  (text "ISOLATION + SERIAL.  Left (x<150): MCU domain (+3V3 / GND).  Right: ISOLATED field domain (+3V3_ISO / GND_ISO) fed ONLY by PS1 (B0303S-1WR3, 1 kV).  Keep GND and GND_ISO planes/copper apart (no overlap, >=2 mm gap) under the barrier.\nDigital isolators U5..U8 = ADuM1201ARZ (ch A: side2->side1, ch B: side1->side2).  U5: TXD(B) / RXD232(A).  U6: RTS(B) / CTS(A).  U7: RS485_DIR(B) / RXD485(A).  U8: MODE_SEL(B) / MODE_RB read-back(A).\nMODE SELECT (MODE_SEL from RP2040 GP5 -> MODE_ISO): 0 = RS-232 (default; MODE_ISO has 100k pull-down R47), 1 = RS-485.  JP4 solder jumper overrides the GPIO: pad1 = force RS-232 (GND_ISO), pad3 = force RS-485 (+3V3_ISO); R48 (1k) lets the jumper override the isolator output.  MODE_RB returns the real MODE_ISO level to the MCU.\n RS-485 driver:  DE and /RE tied together = DIR_ISO AND MODE_ISO (U9).  RS-232 mode: driver disabled, receiver output ignored by firmware.   RS-485 mode: U10 forces MAX-type TX inputs (T1IN = TXD OR MODE, T2IN = RTS OR MODE) to idle-high so the RS-232 line drivers stay quiet.  (SP3232E has no shutdown pin, so its charge pump stays on.)\n Firmware: UART0 TX = GP0 shared by both transceivers; RX is GP1 (RS-232) or GP13 (RS-485) selected by mode; DIR high = transmit.\nRS-232: SP3232EEY (U11, TSSOP-16, 3.3 V, 4x0.1 uF charge-pump caps per MaxLinear SP3222E/SP3232E datasheet, C1:C1+/C1-, C2:C2+/C2-, C3:V+ to GND, C4:V- to GND, C5 VCC bypass).  T1=TXD, R1=RXD, T2=RTS, R2=CTS.  DTE pinout (see Connectors sheet).\nRS-485: SN65HVD72 (U12) half-duplex, 250 kbps, failsafe receiver.  10 R pulse-proof series resistors R45/R46 (TI datasheet Fig. 26) then SM712 TVS on Connectors sheet.  Optional 120 R termination (JP1) and 680 R bias (JP2 pull-up on A, JP3 pull-down on B): close solder jumpers to enable.\nB0303S: unregulated; R44 (150 R) = minimum load (~22 mA, >=10 %% of 303 mA) to keep +3V3_ISO from rising above ~3.6 V.  Cin 4.7 uF (C58), Cout 10 uF (C59) per vendor table for 3.3 V in / 3.3 V out."
    (at 20 24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "384fd1b8-eeab-48e4-a01c-d42e135cf655")
  )
  (text "ISOLATION BARRIER (MCU domain left / field domain right)"
    (at 166 225 90)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cef017cb-39c5-4fb6-a798-6b698b7defce")
  )
